# BCD's Direct3D test programs: the offline shader compiler and what tools/build-dx-tests.sh builds
build/dx-tests/

# BCD's system tests (tools/build-systests.sh): the build directory is not committed; the 32-bit program is the one tracked file of the
# i386 farm's folder (the fallback when a build has no llvm-mingw), the 64-bit one sits tracked in arm64ec-windows like the DirectX tests
build/systests/
!app/Madeira/i386-windows/bcd-systest-x86.exe

# 7-Zip (tools/build-7zip.py, round 603): the unpacked source and the object files; the two programs are tracked in arm64ec-windows
build/7zip/

# BCD runtime installer (tools/build-bcd-runtimes.sh, round 603): the build directory is not committed; the program is tracked in arm64ec-windows
build/bcd-runtimes/
# BCD start helper (tools/build-bcd-helper.sh, round 604): the build directory is not committed; the program is tracked in arm64ec-windows
build/bcd-helper/
# BCD winebrowser.exe (tools/build-bcd-openurl.sh, round 625): the build directory is not committed; the programs are tracked in
